<title>UK: Indosuez ends Cemig warrant market making.</title>
<headline>Indosuez ends Cemig warrant market making.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banque Indosuez on Wednesday said it was stopping market making in warrants of Cemig, the Brazilian power company.</p>
<p>Because of operational constraints for the final settlement of the warrants, its market making would end from 1600 Brazil time, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7770 (fax +44 171 583 7239)</p>
</text>
